      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\nAmendment of the Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986  Schedule 2\n\nHuman Rights Legislation Amendment Act 2017\nCompilation date: 01/09/2021\nRegistered: 03/11/2021\n\n(5) The President has power to do all things necessary or convenient to\nbe done for or in connection with the performance of his or her\nfunctions."
