      },
      "dc:source": "human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(f) to:\n\n(i) inquire into any act or practice that may be inconsistent\nwith or contrary to any human right; and\n\n(ii) if the Commission considers it appropriate to do so—\nendeavour, by conciliation, to effect a settlement of the\nmatters that gave rise to the inquiry; and",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(f) to:\n\n(i) inquire into any act or practice that may be inconsistent\nwith or contrary to any human right; and\n\n(ii) if the Commission considers it appropriate to do so—\nendeavour, by conciliation, to effect a settlement of the\nmatters that gave rise to the inquiry; and",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017-sch-2-sec-6-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "38716e9d49d76f10c53a5fc8daf628dbbcb3366ffa9291b7f895eaf8ba53de13",
      "skos:note": "Commission to endeavour by conciliation to effect a settlement of matters that gave rise to inquiry"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017#sch-2-sec-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 Paragraph 11(1)(f)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(f) to:\n\n(i) inquire into any act or practice that may be inconsistent\nwith or contrary to any human right; and\n\n(ii) if the Commission considers it appropriate to do so—\nendeavour, by conciliation, to effect a settlement of the\nmatters that gave rise to the inquiry; and"
    },
