      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(ba) the Commission is satisfied, having regard to all the\ncircumstances, that an inquiry, or the continuation of an\ninquiry, into the act or practice is not warranted; or\n\nAmendment of the Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986  Schedule 2\n\nHuman Rights Legislation Amendment Act 2017\nCompilation date: 01/09/2021\nRegistered: 03/11/2021",
