    {
      "@id": "concept:human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017-sch-2-sec-36-ss-10",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "36(10) At the end of section 46PF",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017#sch-2-sec-36-ss-10"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017.pdf, p.13",
      "values:originalText": "(10) The President:\n\n(a) must, having regard to:\n\n(i) the nature of the complaint; and\n\n(ii) the needs of the complainant or complainants; and\n\n(iii) the needs of the respondent;\n\nact expeditiously in dealing with the complaint in accordance\nwith this section; and\n\n(b) must use the President’s best endeavours to finish dealing\nwith the complaint within 12 months after the complaint was\nreferred to the President under section 46PD.",
      "skos:definition": "(10) The President:\n\n(a) must, having regard to:\n\n(i) the nature of the complaint; and\n\n(ii) the needs of the complainant or complainants; and\n\n(iii) the needs of the respondent;\n\nact expeditiously in dealing with the complaint in accordance\nwith this section; and\n\n(b) must use the President’s best endeavours to finish dealing\nwith the complaint within 12 months after the complaint was\nreferred to the President under section 46PD.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017-sch-2-sec-36"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017-sch-2-sec-36-ss-10-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017-sch-2-sec-36-ss-10-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "572004089856b149dee2c2e7224e708c8722d16b9593142f6f8c28b818a95fd0",
      "skos:note": "The President must act expeditiously in dealing with a complaint and use best endeavours to finish within 12 months."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017#sch-2-sec-36-ss-10",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "36(10) At the end of section 46PF",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 13,
      "values:originalText": "(10) The President:\n\n(a) must, having regard to:\n\n(i) the nature of the complaint; and\n\n(ii) the needs of the complainant or complainants; and\n\n(iii) the needs of the respondent;\n\nact expeditiously in dealing with the complaint in accordance\nwith this section; and\n\n(b) must use the President’s best endeavours to finish dealing\nwith the complaint within 12 months after the complaint was\nreferred to the President under section 46PD."
    },
