      "values:originalText": "Add:\nNote:\nAn act, omission or practice may not be unlawful discrimination\nbecause an exemption applies (for example, section 18D of the Racial\nDiscrimination Act 1975). Accordingly, consideration by the President\nof the question of whether an act, omission or practice is not unlawful\ndiscrimination will involve consideration of whether an exemption\napplies.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\nNote:\nAn act, omission or practice may not be unlawful discrimination\nbecause an exemption applies (for example, section 18D of the Racial\nDiscrimination Act 1975). Accordingly, consideration by the President\nof the question of whether an act, omission or practice is not unlawful\ndiscrimination will involve consideration of whether an exemption\napplies.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017-sch-2-sec-42-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017-sch-2-sec-42-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017-sch-2-sec-42-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "75c6cd73c65b9d72e3f00ae17512ed7719eec1e323fffbb7cd7f028d30cbddda",
      "skos:note": "Consideration of exemption applies to determination of non-unlawful discrimination"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017#sch-2-sec-42",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "42 At the end of subsection 46PH(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 15,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\nNote:\nAn act, omission or practice may not be unlawful discrimination\nbecause an exemption applies (for example, section 18D of the Racial\nDiscrimination Act 1975). Accordingly, consideration by the President\nof the question of whether an act, omission or practice is not unlawful\ndiscrimination will involve consideration of whether an exemption\napplies."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017-sch-2-sec-42-norm",
