      "cml:premiseText": "(1) Subject to this section, a conference mentioned in subsection 46PJ(1) is to be conducted in such manner as the person presiding at the conference considers appropriate.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person presiding must conduct the proceedings in an appropriate manner."
    },
