      "dc:source": "human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(3A) The application must not be made unless:\n\n(a) the court concerned grants leave to make the application; or\n\n(b) the complaint was terminated under paragraph 46PH(1)(h);\nor\n\n(c) the complaint was terminated under paragraph 46PH(1B)(b).\n\nSchedule 2  Amendment of the Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986\n\nHuman Rights Legislation Amendment Act 2017\n\nCompilation date: 01/09/2021\nRegistered: 03/11/2021",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(3A) The application must not be made unless:\n\n(a) the court concerned grants leave to make the application; or\n\n(b) the complaint was terminated under paragraph 46PH(1)(h);\nor\n\n(c) the complaint was terminated under paragraph 46PH(1B)(b).\n\nSchedule 2  Amendment of the Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986\n\nHuman Rights Legislation Amendment Act 2017\n\nCompilation date: 01/09/2021\nRegistered: 03/11/2021",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017-sch-2-sec-53-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017-sch-2-sec-53-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d636fd5b1de32de0540803b0526205d8be0878f4612d383e6c42fb178e088596",
      "skos:note": "Application must not be made unless court grants leave or complaint is terminated under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017#sch-2-sec-53",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53 After subsection 46PO(3)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(3A) The application must not be made unless:\n\n(a) the court concerned grants leave to make the application; or\n\n(b) the complaint was terminated under paragraph 46PH(1)(h);\nor\n\n(c) the complaint was terminated under paragraph 46PH(1B)(b).\n\nSchedule 2  Amendment of the Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986\n\nHuman Rights Legislation Amendment Act 2017\n\nCompilation date: 01/09/2021\nRegistered: 03/11/2021"
    },
