      },
      "dc:source": "human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017.pdf, p.22",
      "values:originalText": "Despite the amendment of section 46M of the Australian Human Rights\nCommission Act 1986 made by this Schedule, that section continues to\napply, in relation to a report received by the Minister under\nparagraph 46C(1)(a) of that Act before the commencement of this item,\nas if that amendment had not been made.\n\nAmendment of the Native Title Act 1993  Schedule 3\n\nHuman Rights Legislation Amendment Act 2017\nCompilation date: 01/09/2021\nRegistered: 03/11/2021",
      "skos:definition": "Despite the amendment of section 46M of the Australian Human Rights\nCommission Act 1986 made by this Schedule, that section continues to\napply, in relation to a report received by the Minister under\nparagraph 46C(1)(a) of that Act before the commencement of this item,\nas if that amendment had not been made.\n\nAmendment of the Native Title Act 1993  Schedule 3\n\nHuman Rights Legislation Amendment Act 2017\nCompilation date: 01/09/2021\nRegistered: 03/11/2021",
      "cml:asserts": [
